<article class="env-definition" id="08A3">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/08A3">Definition <span data-tag="08A3">33.35.7</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a field. Let $n \geq 0$. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a coherent sheaf on $\mathbf{P}^ n_ k$. We say $\mathcal{F}$ is <em>$m$-regular</em> if </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  H^ i(\mathbf{P}^ n_ k, \mathcal{F}(m - i)) = 0  \]
</div>
  <p> for $i = 1, \ldots , n$. </p>
</article>